    "description": "Shibuya Corporation engages in the manufacture and sale of products in the packaging plant, mechatronics systems, and agricultural equipment business in Japan and internationally. The company offers beverages, daily necessities and chemicals, including aseptic filling, filling, packaging, inspection, and cleaning systems; pharmaceutical and medical, such as aseptic systems, isolator, pharmaceutical manufacturing, regenerative medicine, medical, and cleaning systems; smart agriculture and food processing, comprising grading and sorting, sensor, and food processing systems; semiconductor, including solder ball mounters, high-accuracy die bonders, flip chip, wire bonders, test handlers and taping machines, handlers for power semiconductors, and ultrasonic cleaning systems. It also provides fiber laser cutting, gas laser, waterjet cutting, laser ablation, other cutting, laser welding, and hydraulic presses machines. In addition, the company offers IT/OT total solutions, such as engineering, production management, maintenance, and support services systems. Shibuya Corporation was founded in 1931 and is based in Kanazawa, Japan."
